OL,3,GNEWSAHepworth piece fetches more than
OL,4,A#6m at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "defining masterwork" by Dame Barbara
OL,7,FHepworth has fetched #6.19m at auction.
OL,9,FSculpture with Colour (Eos) was
OL,10,Fexpected to sell for between #5m and
OL,11,F#8m at the Christie's auction house
OL,12,Fmodern British and Irish art sale on
OL,13,FWednesday.
OL,15,FInspired by the Cornish landscape,
OL,16,FHepworth created the artwork in 1946,
OL,17,Fnaming it after the Greek goddess of
OL,18,Fdawn.
